<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Third-party licences – tpt-ruc-nz</title>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>This file lists the third-party crates compiled into tpt-ruc-nz and the licence texts they require. It is generated from <code>about.toml</code> and the lock file. Regenerate it with <code>cargo about generate about.hbs -o THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.html</code>.</p>

<h2>Licences</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}} crate{{#if count_plural}}s{{/if}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<h3>Used by</h3>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
